  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656472",
      "title": "TD: Using the Form State",
      "lectureOrder": 517,
      "videoOrder": 473,
      "sourceHash": "1154005dd6dfc61d99f3277656c2acc26b941c55f8614ea03c2566d4864a26f9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.52,
          "end": 4.59,
          "en": "-: In the last lecture, we found out that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.59,
          "end": 7.02,
          "en": "Angular tracks the state of each control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.02,
          "end": 9.48,
          "en": "of the form, whether it's valid and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.48,
          "end": 13.62,
          "en": "And conditionally also adds these CSS classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.62,
          "end": 16.29,
          "en": "Now with that information, we can go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.29,
          "end": 19.38,
          "en": "to our form and you take advantage of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.38,
          "end": 22.05,
          "en": "Before diving into the CSS classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.05,
          "end": 23.94,
          "en": "The easiest way of taking advantage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.94,
          "end": 26.04,
          "en": "is down here on the submit button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.04,
          "end": 27.33,
          "en": "Let's disable the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.33,
          "end": 29.34,
          "en": "if the form is not valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.34,
          "end": 31.02,
          "en": "So I'll just split this over multiple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.02,
          "end": 33.96,
          "en": "lines and add some property binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.96,
          "end": 36.75,
          "en": "I want to bind to the disabled property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.75,
          "end": 38.01,
          "en": "which will add the,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.01,
          "end": 39.96,
          "en": "or which will set the disabled state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.96,
          "end": 41.82,
          "en": "of this button to true or false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 41.82,
          "end": 43.65,
          "en": "depending on some condition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43.65,
          "end": 45.69,
          "en": "And I will specify the condition here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.69,
          "end": 48.6,
          "en": "Now, I could say true here to always disable it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.6,
          "end": 50.492,
          "en": "That of course is not super useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 50.492,
          "end": 54.27,
          "en": "Instead here I want to check whether the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 54.27,
          "end": 55.59,
          "en": "remember we do have access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 55.59,
          "end": 59.25,
          "en": "to it on this F local reference here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.25,
          "end": 61.8,
          "en": "So if this form is valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 64.95,
          "en": "would you be precise if it is not valid?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 64.95,
          "end": 66.93,
          "en": "So if this form is not valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 66.93,
          "end": 68.7,
          "en": "the button should be disabled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 68.7,
          "end": 70.53,
          "en": "and we can actually see this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 70.53,
          "end": 71.64,
          "en": "once this reloads that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 71.64,
          "end": 73.26,
          "en": "now the button is disabled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 73.26,
          "end": 77.28,
          "en": "and only if I enter some valid values here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 77.28,
          "end": 79.53,
          "en": "I can hit the submit button again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 79.53,
          "end": 82.14,
          "en": "So this is the first improvement in place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 82.14,
          "end": 84.6,
          "en": "The second improvement is to take advantage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 87.24,
          "en": "of these CSS classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 87.24,
          "end": 90.12,
          "en": "We do get these classes added automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 90.12,
          "end": 91.95,
          "en": "So we can now go to the style sheet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 91.95,
          "end": 94.05,
          "en": "of this app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 94.05,
          "end": 97.11,
          "en": "and we could say that on NG invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 97.11,
          "end": 98.94,
          "en": "we want to give it a red border.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 98.94,
          "end": 101.43,
          "en": "So one pixel solid red.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 101.43,
          "end": 103.97999999999999,
          "en": "Sounds like a solid idea, doesn't it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 103.97999999999999,
          "end": 106.86,
          "en": "Well, if we do this, you see everything's red now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 109.89,
          "en": "The two controls, but also the overall form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 109.89,
          "end": 111.45,
          "en": "The reason for this is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 111.45,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "that our overall form is also invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 116.39,
          "en": "and that Angular also adds the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 116.39,
          "end": 119.49000000000001,
          "en": "NG invalid class CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 119.49000000000001,
          "end": 121.68,
          "en": "to the form element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 121.68,
          "end": 123.66,
          "en": "So a better approach would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 123.66,
          "end": 127.47,
          "en": "to make sure that it is not added to the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 127.47,
          "end": 129.45,
          "en": "Now, there are a couple of ways of doing this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 129.45,
          "end": 132.54,
          "en": "and it's all just pure CSS logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 132.54,
          "end": 136.2,
          "en": "One idea would be that we want to be inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 136.2,
          "end": 138.72,
          "en": "of the form element, but then it will still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 138.72,
          "end": 142.07999999999998,
          "en": "place these red borders around grouping devs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 142.07999999999998,
          "end": 143.22,
          "en": "We will have a look at what",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 143.22,
          "end": 144.483,
          "en": "I mean with this later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 144.483,
          "end": 146.43,
          "en": "So the best way is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 146.43,
          "end": 148.53,
          "en": "to simply be explicit that we want to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 148.53,
          "end": 150.87,
          "en": "add it on inputs, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 150.87,
          "end": 153.51,
          "en": "And of course you could also add select here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 153.51,
          "end": 155.34,
          "en": "So input with NG invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 155.34,
          "end": 157.89,
          "en": "or select with NG invalid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 157.89,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "and which other elements you have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 161.57999999999998,
          "en": "Just be creative here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 161.57999999999998,
          "end": 163.44,
          "en": "There are different ways of achieving the skill.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 163.44,
          "end": 164.37,
          "en": "In the end, you just want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 164.37,
          "end": 166.17000000000002,
          "en": "to make sure that the border",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 166.17000000000002,
          "end": 168.99,
          "en": "is applied to the right controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 168.99,
          "end": 171.42000000000002,
          "en": "Now, with this in place, we see that now we only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 171.42000000000002,
          "end": 173.836,
          "en": "have a red border around the invalid controls,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 173.836,
          "end": 176.1,
          "en": "but we do have the border right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 176.1,
          "end": 179.64,
          "en": "from the start, which is also not great because,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 179.64,
          "end": 182.13,
          "en": "I at least want to give the user the chance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 182.13,
          "end": 184.83,
          "en": "of changing it before showing a warning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 184.83,
          "end": 186.66,
          "en": "showing that it's wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 186.66,
          "end": 188.76,
          "en": "So a better approach might be to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 188.76,
          "end": 191.49,
          "en": "that we only add a red border to input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 191.49,
          "end": 194.37,
          "en": "which has the CSS class NG invalid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 194.37,
          "end": 198.03,
          "en": "and also the CSS class NG touched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 198.03,
          "end": 200.94,
          "en": "So that user has to at least click into it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 200.94,
          "end": 203.37,
          "en": "Now, by default, we don't see anything red",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 203.37,
          "end": 205.47,
          "en": "even though the form is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 205.47,
          "end": 207.18,
          "en": "But if you click in there and decide,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 207.18,
          "end": 209.37,
          "en": "Yeah, I'm done. This is my value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 209.37,
          "end": 211.65,
          "en": "Well, now you see we have a red border",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 211.65,
          "end": 214.02,
          "en": "because now we had a chance of changing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 214.02,
          "end": 215.19,
          "en": "We didn't change it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 215.19,
          "end": 217.68,
          "en": "It is invalid and we want to show this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 217.68,
          "end": 219.57,
          "en": "And with that, we're taking advantage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 219.57,
          "end": 222.99,
          "en": "of this form state handled by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 222.99,
          "end": 224.64,
          "en": "We disable the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 224.64,
          "end": 227.31,
          "en": "and we show a visual feedback to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 227.31,
          "end": 229.35,
          "en": "Now, you could of course go much further.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 229.35,
          "end": 232.35,
          "en": "You could also add a warning message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 232.35,
          "end": 236.73,
          "en": "below this input here, for example, and output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 236.73,
          "end": 240.99,
          "en": "Please enter a valid value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 240.99,
          "end": 244.23,
          "en": "or be more precise than that, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 244.23,
          "end": 248.46,
          "en": "and add NGF to conditionally show this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 248.46,
          "end": 251.04,
          "en": "if the input value is wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 251.04,
          "end": 253.11,
          "en": "Well, this gives us one additional",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 253.11,
          "end": 254.49,
          "en": "problem though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 254.49,
          "end": 258.51,
          "en": "How do we determine whether this input here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 258.51,
          "end": 262.23,
          "en": "or this control here does hold a wrong value?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 262.23,
          "end": 264.903,
          "en": "We'll take a closer look in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
